---
fmContentType: glossaryEntry
term: "Terpinolene"
letter: "T"
anchor: "terpinolene"
category: "terpenes"
---

A cannabis terpene with a complex, fruity, floral, herbal aroma — found in apples, cumin, lilac, and tea tree. Less common than myrcene or limonene but present in notable concentrations in some popular strains. Associated with uplifting effects by some users, though its effect profile is less consistent in reports than other major terpenes.
